==Format==
*'''Group Stage''' ''(July 26 - August 8)''
**Two single round-robin groups of six teams each
**All series are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
***2–0 awards winner 3 points
***2–1 awards winner 2 points and loser 1 point
**{{bgctext|up|Top two teams}} from each group advance to playoffs
**{{bgctext|down|Remaining teams}} are eliminated
**{{collapsible rules|1|title=Click here for tiebreaker rules|texts=
*Two or more teams tie
*#Head to head
*#Neustadtl score
*#Comparative results against common opponents, from highest-ranked downward
*#Additional draw
}}

*'''Playoffs''' ''(August 9 - August 12)''
**Double-elimination bracket
**Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo3}}, all other series are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
**Four invited teams are directly seeded to the playoffs

